From 20c9a7d609fd9866a61489af55050c249e74bd38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuepixel <yuepixel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:56:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] qwen4_exp: wire prompt-lookup into the batched decoder
 (per-stream backlog) + calibrate gate costs

P7.1.1/P7.1.2: multi.py _draft_all stages each stream's accepted rows in a per-stream backlog; streams.py exposes lookup_drafted/accepted metrics; lookup.py costs_for carries measured verify/MTP timings plus an env-gated TF_EXL3_LOOKUP_DEBUG hook. Default stays forced l7:2; the auto gate remains experimental (its cost model is biased, see handover).
---
